  "description": "Cruise in comfort and style with the Tracer Siena GT 26” Chopper Stretch Cruiser Fat Tire Bike. Featuring an oversized Hi-ten steel frame and durable 26”x3.0” fat tires, this bike is perfect for smooth rides across various terrains. Choose between 1-speed or 7-speed options, both equipped with a sturdy mechanical disc brake for reliable stopping power. The high-rise handlebar and spring-loaded saddle add extra comfort for long rides. Available in multiple color options, this cruiser is designed for those who want to ride with boldness and ease.\n\nCOLORS\nBlack/Polished, Gray, Green, Matte Black/Black, Matte Black/Polished, Red/Polished\n\nFORK\nTracer Triple Tree Aluminum Dual Crown Disc Brake\n\nSADDLE\nVacuum elastic PVC leather high density PU foam with springs\n\nSHIFTERS\n\n1 Speed: N/A\n7 Speed: Shimano SL-RS35-R, 7-speed\n\nREAR DERAILLEUR\n\n1 Speed: N/A\n7 Speed: Shimano Tourney TY300\n\nBRAKE\n\n1 Speed: N/A\n7 Speed: mechanical disc, 160mm rotor\n\nCASSETTE\nShimano TZ500, 14-28, 7 speed.\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\nBMX Cranks set Bottom Bracket Cr-Mo axle.\n\nRIMS\nAlloy FAT Front 3' Rear 4\" 26” *36H*14G Spoke wheelset.\n\nWEIGHT\nThe most accurate way to determine any bike’s weight is to have your local dealer weigh it for you. Many brands strive to list the lowest possible weight, but in reality, weight can vary based on size, finish, hardware and accessories. All our bikes are designed for best-in-class weight and ride quality.",
